        \combine_{f,g}(u + t \cdot v) = (u_\alpha + t\cdot v_\alpha) f(u_X + t \cdot v_X) + (u_\beta + t \cdot v_\beta) g(u_Z + t \cdot v_Z)\;. \label{eq:combine-lines}
      \end{equation}


